Recommended Computer Specifications
 
 
Standard Business PC
Recommended
Suitable for retail shops, supermarkets, and wholesale billing.
Processor
Intel Core i5 (12th Gen or newer) or AMD Ryzen 5
RAM
8 GB minimum; 16 GB recommended
Storage
512 GB SSD
Operating System
Windows 11 64-bit
Display
22-inch or 24-inch Full HD monitor
Connectivity
Gigabit Ethernet, Wi-Fi, and at least 4 USB ports
Required billing peripherals
 
 
1. Barcode Scanner
USB handheld 1D/2D barcode scanner. Ensure compatibility with the barcode formats used by your inventory products.
 
 
2. Thermal Receipt Printer
80 mm thermal printer with USB connectivity; choose a model compatible with your billing software and receipt format.
 
 
3. Barcode Label Printer (Optional)
A dedicated thermal label printer for printing product barcodes, MRP labels, garment tags, and grocery labels. Choose direct thermal or thermal transfer based on label durability requirements.
 
